Binary to vcc hdf5

pre-conditions: hostlog-client, tdf files, binary file to decode

run the following command in cmd under hostlog-client folder and replace the actual paths with the parts with {}

hostlog.bat offline binary-playback --binary-files {path-to-binary-file} --output {path-to-output} --definitions {path-to-tdf-folder} --to-hdf5

This flag is highly recommended to add:

--appconfig "output.files.hdf5_decode_enum_as_int=False"  # the decoded values are enum

--appconfig "output.files.enable_hdf5_named_datasets=True" # topic names are human-readable instead of topic-xxxx

if you would like to have both, the syntax is:



hostlog.bat offline binary-playback --binary-files {path-to-binary-file} --output {path-to-output} --definitions {path-to-tdf-folder} --to-hdf5 --appconfig "output.files.hdf5_decode_enum_as_int=False,output.files.enable_hdf5_named_datasets=True"




More flags can be used with the command line if needed

