Binary to zen hdf5

pre-conditions: wsl, ad_adas decoder, binary file to decode

Download the decoder matches the ad-adas-a version from Index of AD-Zenuity-External-LTS/dcf_decoder or Index of AD-Zenuity-External-LTS/zenseact/ad-adas-decoder or wherever is available and unzip it.

Since dcf_decoder is deprecated, only ad_adas decoder is shown.

run the following command in wsl under decoder folder and replace the actual paths with the parts with {}

LD_LIBRARY_PATH={decoder_lib_path} ad_adas_decoder --input_file={bin_wsl_path} --output_folder={bin_wsl_out_path} --overwrite=true --ignore_checksum=true
{decoder_lib_path} is the path that has libhdf5.so and libhdf5_cpp.so. It is "." if they are in the same folder that runs the command.
{decoder_wsl_path} is where ad_adas File is.
The paths here should all be Linux format.
